# RATING CRITERIA

## Score 0-30 (Gibberish/Fake)
- Random characters with no discernible meaning
- Computer-generated nonsense patterns
- Completely fabricated text with no invoice elements
- Deliberately obfuscated content

## Score 31-60 (Highly Suspicious)
- Severe structural issues (missing all key invoice fields)
- Incoherent mixing of unrelated text fragments
- OCR text that makes no semantic sense even with errors
- Critical fields replaced with placeholder text

## Score 61-80 (Possible Legitimate with OCR Errors)
- Recognizable invoice structure present
- Contains typical invoice elements (vendor, amounts, dates)
- OCR errors present but underlying document appears real
- Text fragmentation but meaningful content recoverable

## Score 81-100 (Clear Legitimate Invoice)
- Well-structured invoice with clear sections
- All critical fields present and coherent
- Vendor information, line items, totals logical
- Minor OCR errors acceptable if overall structure valid

